Q1 (voutn vinp net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
Q2 (voutp vinn net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
Q3 (net2 vb net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
R1 (net1 VSS) resistor r=50
R2 (net0 net2) resistor r=50
R3 (net3 net2) resistor r=50
RD1 (VDD voutn) resistor r=1k
RD2 (VDD voutp) resistor r=1k
